.Sy -engine
option was deprecated in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
The
.Sy -oldwithold ,
.Sy -newwithnew ,
.Sy -newwithold ,
.Sy -oldwithnew ,
The
.Sy -srvcertout ,
and
.Sy -serial
option were added in OpenSSL 3.2, as well as an extension of
